---
layout: layouts/base.njk
key: home
bodyClass: home
permalink: /
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="h-hero">
<canvas class="embers" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
<div class="in">
<div class="eyebrow">An independent guide · No tracking, no accounts</div>
<h1 id="h-hero"><span class="ln"><span>Before</span></span><span class="ln"><span>the <span class="g">music,</span></span></span><span class="ln"><span>the <span class="y">reason</span><span class="r">ing.</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="hero-grid">
<p class="lede">Most of the world met Rastafari through a record sleeve. This is the story underneath: a hillside commune burned by police, a forgotten Bible written in New Jersey, a 1963 crackdown the Jamaican state took 54 years to apologise for, and a living faith that now stretches from Shashamane to Ruātoria.</p>
<div class="hero-facts" role="list">
<div role="listitem"><b class="tabular">1930</b><span>Ras Tafari crowned Haile Selassie I</span></div>
<div role="listitem"><b class="tabular">3</b><span>principal Mansions, and many who walk with none</span></div>
<div role="listitem"><b class="tabular">500</b><span>acres granted at Shashamane, 1948</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="hero-cta"><a class="big-btn" href="/roots/">Start with the roots →</a></p>
</div>
<div class="bands" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
</section>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="marquee-track">
{%- set mq = ["I and I","Livity","Ital","Inity","Overstand","Iration","Higher Heights","Groundation","Reasoning","Zion","Irie","Jah"] -%}
{%- for rep in [1,2] %}{% for w in mq %}<span>{% if loop.index0 % 3 == 0 %}<b>{{ w }}</b>{% else %}{{ w }}{% endif %}</span><span class="mq-star">✦</span>{% endfor %}{% endfor -%}
</div></div>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="h-chapters">
<div class="in">
<div class="sec-head"><div class="eyebrow">The guide</div><h2 id="h-chapters">{{ collections.chapters.length | numberWord }} <span class="acc-y">chapters</span></h2></div>
<ol class="ch-grid">
{%- for ch in collections.chapters %}
<li class="ch-card reveal"><a href="{{ ch.url }}"><span class="ch-num tabular">{{ ch.data.order | pad }}</span><span class="ch-label">{{ ch.data.navLabel }}</span><span class="ch-desc">{{ ch.data.description }}</span><span class="ch-go" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec alt" aria-labelledby="h-feature">
<div class="in"><div class="split">
<div class="read">
<div class="eyebrow">21 April 1966</div>
<h2 id="h-feature" class="h-mid">The day the <span class="acc-g">Emperor</span> came</h2>
<p class="lede">A huge crowd flooded Palisadoes airport in the rain. Haile Selassie waited on the aircraft steps until the elder Mortimo Planno was invited up to calm the people. Rastas still mark the date as Grounation Day.</p>
<p><a href="/timeline/">Explore the full timeline →</a></p>
</div>
<div>{% video "visit-1966" %}</div>
</div></div>
</section>

{% include "partials/reasoning.njk" %}

{% if collections.articles.length %}
<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="h-latest">
<div class="in">
<div class="sec-head"><div class="eyebrow">Articles</div><h2 id="h-latest">Latest <span class="acc-r">reading</span></h2></div>
<div class="article-list">
{%- for a in collections.articles | head(3) %}
<a class="article-card reveal" href="{{ a.url }}"><span class="meta">{{ a.date | dateNice }}{% if a.data.topic %} · {{ a.data.topic }}{% endif %}</span><b>{{ a.data.title }}</b><span>{{ a.data.summary }}</span></a>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
<p style="margin-top:24px"><a href="/articles/">All articles →</a></p>
</div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% include "partials/share.njk" %}
